## What the data is, and is not

Each entry carries a `confidence` field (`high` / `medium` / `low`, shown in the
app as Verified / Partly verified / Unverified) and a `verify` field naming what
a human still needs to check. Entries are compiled from public sources; they are
**not** endorsed or confirmed by the organisations listed unless a source says
so. If you reuse the data, carry the confidence levels with it rather than
presenting every row as an established fact.

Corrections from listed organisations are welcome — see the README.

## Third-party data

`data/benelux.geojson` is derived from Natural Earth (1:50m Admin 0 – Countries),
which is in the **public domain**: <https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/>
Map tiles are served by CARTO from OpenStreetMap data (© OpenStreetMap
contributors, ODbL) and are not redistributed by this repository.
